# head/adult/man/nose_button: the man's button nose (A3): one skin-shadow pixel between the eyes; the profile bump in side views
# The slice (P2b wave 1, FOLK-BODY); A3's pixels are the reference (docs/ref/style_a3). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body man
role nose button
layer face
anchor head
keys rest

view D key rest origin -8 -11
|r

view U key rest origin 0 0
|.

view R key rest origin -14 -10
|sq

view L key rest origin 0 -10
|qt
